Project: Dandelion Lite
Repository: https://github.com/GameChangerFinance/dandelion-lite
Website: https://github.com/GameChangerFinance/dandelion-lite
Status: Production
Version: See Git tags and GitHub Releases for published versions
License: MIT (see LICENSE)
Creators: Adriano Fiorenza (GameChanger Finance); Maarten Menhere (M2Tec)
Core Maintainer: Adriano Fiorenza (GitHub: zxpectre)
Platform: Linux; Podman or Docker with Docker Compose
Purpose: Self-hostable, modular Cardano node and reusable API infrastructure for independent Dandelion Node Operators.
Services: Cardano node, Ogmios, cardano-db-sync, PostgreSQL, HAProxy, Cardano Submit API, Blockfrost, Cardano GraphQL MKII, Unimatrix, PostgREST and supporting services. Availability and support vary by configuration; see README.md.
Documentation: README.md; docs/README.md; docs/concept.md
Dependencies: Container images and system tools defined by docker-compose.yml, network-specific .env examples and deployment scripts; consult these files for authoritative versions and configuration.
Governance: GOVERNANCE.md
Security: SECURITY.md
